  <item>
    <title>vol.93 大人为什么总是顺口说出那句“为你好”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e6f33b1e94ae6921c4737d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e6f33b1e94ae6921c4737d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 03:50:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>催睡觉、催学习、催吃饭……我们嘴上的"为你好"，有多少是怕自己不称职的慌张？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客还是和小孩姐对谈，撕开"为你好"的包装纸，看看里面藏着的，到底是谁的焦虑和拧巴？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期Highlight：</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> &nbsp;大人的着急是"替我们干着急"</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> &nbsp;着急在暗处捆绑着我们</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> &nbsp;吴老师从"出了名的着急"是如何慢下来的？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> &nbsp;大人 "为你好"的真相：焦虑投射</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">13:34</a> &nbsp;面对不确定，如何从0开始学习新领域？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> &nbsp;大人的自恋结构怎会如此之大？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> &nbsp;一味追求“做自己”其实可拧巴了</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> &nbsp;很多孩子在用生病告诉家长：焦虑投射是不健康的</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> &nbsp;死学 vs 为自己学</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> &nbsp;当道理失效时：让孩子躺平试试看</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> &nbsp;小孩姐给大人的两条建议：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>不要再着急了</span></strong><span>——越着急，事情可能搞砸得越快</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>放下家长架子，和孩子一起学</span></strong><span>——时代不一样了，AI时代和过去完全不同，过往经验不一定奏效，与其拧巴焦虑，不如迭代自己。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>相关推荐：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>往期节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2c27169b6a485e89cde1f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2c27169b6a485e89cde1f"><span>vol.01 灌输式教育对10后为什么没用了？</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>进听友群请添加微信：meshiwj1128（备注”小孩姐“）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/4wzCK0mMJni" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/4wzCK0mMJni"><span>不做老师的吴老师</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小孩姐提问来信&amp;商务合作：561431217@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
